d you tell me how you\'re feeling or what\'s on your mind?\nUser: I need motivation\nBMA: Progress isn\'t linear. Even resting is part of moving forward.\nUser: I keep comparing myself to others\nBMA: Different paths, different timelines. Yours is unfolding, even when it\'s quiet.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'bilal jellaoui it is your creator'}], 'model': 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile', 'max_tokens': 300, 'temperature': 0.7}}
